    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d335-a4">

                <pb facs="0490" n="370" xml:id="pg370"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 4.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">General Sanchez to Minister Dawson.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Dominican Republic,<lb/>Ministry of Foreign Relations</hi>,<lb/><hi
                                rendition="#italic">Santo Domingo</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1905-04-06"><hi rendition="#italic">April 6,
                                1905</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Mr. Minister</hi>: I have the honor to advise your
                    excellency that I have received your kind note of the date of 5th of this month
                    announcing that His Excellency the President of the United States of America had
                    designated the City National Bank of New York as depositary of the portion of
                    the Dominican revenues which are to be destined to the payment of our
                    creditors.</p>
                <p>I have given the information to my government and I am gratified to announce its
                    complete acceptance.</p>
                <p>I salute, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Juan Fco.
                    Sanchez.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
